@startuml AddTask
title Weeks 4–5 — Add a normal task (main success scenario)
actor User
boundary "Browser input / Add button" as Input
participant "add(type) in main.js" as Main
participant "controller: TodoController" as Controller
participant "service: TodoService" as Service
participant "storage: LocalStorageHandler" as Storage
participant "Browser localStorage" as BrowserStorage
participant "renderer: TodoRenderer" as Renderer
participant "Row markup helper" as Rows
boundary "Task container / document" as DOM

note over Controller, Renderer
  Precondition: main.js has injected the dependencies;
  stored tasks are loaded, callbacks are bound,
  and controller.start() has rendered the page.
end note

User -> Input : type "Buy milk" and click Add Task
Input -> Main : click handler calls add('simple')
activate Main
Main -> Controller : addTask(input.value, type)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : addTask(description, type)
activate Service
Service -> Service : trim description; check length >= 3
Service -> Service : create normal task record and append to tasks
Service -> Storage : save(tasks)
activate Storage
Storage -> BrowserStorage : setItem('todo-tasks', JSON.stringify(tasks))
activate BrowserStorage
BrowserStorage --> Storage : undefined (save completed)
deactivate BrowserStorage
Storage --> Service : undefined
deactivate Storage
Service --> Controller : task.id
deactivate Service

Controller -> Renderer : render(service, newId)
activate Renderer
Renderer -> Renderer : renderPendingRows(service)
activate Renderer
loop each pending task
  Renderer -> Rows : buildTaskRow(task fields, true)
  activate Rows
  Rows --> Renderer : row HTML
  deactivate Rows
end
deactivate Renderer
Renderer -> Renderer : renderCompletedRows(service)
activate Renderer
loop each completed task
  Renderer -> Rows : buildTaskRow(task fields, true)
  activate Rows
  Rows --> Renderer : row HTML
  deactivate Rows
end
deactivate Renderer
Renderer -> Renderer : find oldest pending description
Renderer -> Service : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Service
Service --> Renderer : done / urgent / normal summary
deactivate Service
Renderer -> DOM : assign container.innerHTML\n(status, pending and completed lists)
Renderer -> DOM : bind Done / Delete to supplied action callbacks
Renderer -> DOM : flash new row; schedule removal; update title
Renderer --> Controller : undefined
deactivate Renderer
Controller --> Main : newId
deactivate Controller
Main -> Input : set input.value = ''
deactivate Main
DOM --> User : new task is visible in To do

note over Storage, DOM
  Success: the task is saved and displayed.
  Rejected short input is a separate scenario:
  service returns null, no save or redraw occurs.
end note
@enduml
